Feature: MCP setting for new Grouped Approval types

  Scenario: Verify MCP setting for Grouped Approvals is listed under Development Use Only
    Given I am on the MCP settings page
    When I navigate to the Development Use Only section
    Then I should see the setting "Approvals - Approvals List (V3) - Grouped Approvals - Record File & Resource Publish (development use only)"

Python:
from behave import given, when, then

@given('I am on the MCP settings page')
def step_given_on_mcp_settings_page(context):
    context.browser.get('http://example.com/mcp-settings')

@when('I navigate to the Development Use Only section')
def step_when_navigate_to_development_use_only(context):
    context.browser.find_element_by_id('development-use-only-section').click()

@then('I should see the setting "Approvals - Approvals List (V3) - Grouped Approvals - Record File & Resource Publish (development use only)"')
def step_then_see_grouped_approvals_setting(context):
    setting_text = context.browser.find_element_by_id('grouped-approvals-setting').text
    assert setting_text == "Approvals - Approvals List (V3) - Grouped Approvals - Record File & Resource Publish (development use only)"

